---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/ui/Button.astro';
import { FileSearch, CalendarOff, FileSpreadsheet, FileText, Calendar, CheckCircle2, AlertCircle, FileBox } from 'lucide-react';

const title = "Qué Hacemos | CertifiTrack";
const description = "Descubre cómo limpiamos tu desordenada carpeta de COIs. Extraemos fechas, marcamos coberturas faltantes y te devolvemos un registro limpio.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  {/* Hero */}
  <section class="spacing-section bg-background border-b border-border">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl text-center">
      <h1 class="text-h1 text-foreground spacing-heading text-balance">Hacemos el trabajo manual que odias.</h1>
      <p class="text-body-large spacing-paragraph">No creaste una empresa para leer pólizas de seguro. Convertimos una carpeta de PDFs desorganizados en datos útiles.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* The Process */}
  <section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-surface border-b border-border overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl space-y-24 lg:space-y-32">
      
      {/* 01: Find */}
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <div class="lg:w-1/2">
          <div class="text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">01 &mdash; Auditoría</div>
          <h2 class="text-h2 text-foreground spacing-heading">Encontramos lo que falta.</h2>
          <p class="text-body spacing-paragraph">Envíenos su lista maestra de subcontratistas junto con su carpeta de PDFs. Hacemos coincidir manualmente cada documento con el subcontratista correcto, revelando instantáneamente quién no ha proporcionado su documentación.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 w-full">
          <div class="bg-background rounded-xl border border-border shadow-subtle p-6 max-w-sm mx-auto">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-medium text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-4">Reconciliación</div>
            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/50">
                <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Atlas Ridge Mechanical</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-status-active font-medium tracking-wide">ENCONTRADO</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/50">
                <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Summit Valley Concrete</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-status-missing font-medium tracking-wide">FALTANTE</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/50">
                <span class="font-medium text-foreground">Cedar Point Roofing</span>
                <span class="text-[10px] text-status-active font-medium tracking-wide">ENCONTRADO</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 02: Extract */}
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 w-full order-2 lg:order-1">
          <div class="bg-background rounded-xl border border-border shadow-subtle p-6 max-w-sm mx-auto relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-medium text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-[0.1em] mb-4 relative z-10">Extracción de Datos</div>
            <div class="space-y-4 relative z-10">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline border-b border-border/60 pb-2">
                <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium">Responsabilidad Civil</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-status-expired">14 Ene, 2026</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline border-b border-border/60 pb-2">
                <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium">Comp. Trabajadores</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">30 Nov, 2026</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
                <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium">Responsabilidad Auto</span>
                <span class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">01 Oct, 2026</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:w-1/2 order-1 lg:order-2">
          <div class="text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">02 &mdash; Extracción</div>
          <h2 class="text-h2 text-foreground spacing-heading">Extraemos los datos críticos.</h2>
          <p class="text-body spacing-paragraph">No tiene tiempo para entrecerrar los ojos ante formularios ACORD escaneados. Leemos los PDFs, encontramos las fechas de vencimiento y los límites de Responsabilidad Civil, Compensación de Trabajadores y Auto, y marcamos cualquier cosa que no cumpla.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 03: Organize & Return */}
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="max-w-2xl text-center">
          <div class="text-xs font-medium text-muted-foreground tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">03 &mdash; Organización y Entrega</div>
          <h2 class="text-h2 text-foreground spacing-heading">Entregamos un registro limpio.</h2>
          <p class="text-body spacing-paragraph">Devolvemos una hoja de cálculo de Excel estructurada que realmente puede usar. Filtre instantáneamente por estado para ver quién necesita una llamada de seguimiento y revise los límites de cobertura exactos extraídos de los formularios.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full max-w-3xl">
          <div class="flex flex-col bg-background rounded-xl border border-border shadow-elevated overflow-hidden">
            <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-muted/30 border-b border-border flex items-center justify-between">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <FileSpreadsheet class="w-4 h-4 text-muted-foreground" />
                <span class="text-xs font-medium text-foreground tracking-wide">Registro_Maestro_Final.xlsx</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground font-semibold">Entregable</span>
            </div>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="w-full text-left text-[11px] font-sans whitespace-nowrap">
                <thead class="bg-muted/10 text-muted-foreground border-b border-border">
                  <tr>
                    <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Subcontratista</th>
                    <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Venc. RC</th>
                    <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Venc. CT</th>
                    <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Venc. Auto</th>
                    <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Límite RC</th>
                    <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Límite CT</th>
                    <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Límite Auto</th>
                    <th class="px-3 py-2 font-medium">Estado</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody class="divide-y divide-border text-foreground">
                  <tr class="hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors">
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Atlas Ridge Mechanical</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">12/10/26</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">12/10/26</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">12/10/26</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">$1M / $2M</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">$1M</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">$1M</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-active-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 font-semibold text-status-active border border-status-active-border text-[9px]">VIGENTE</span></td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors">
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Cedar Point Roofing</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-status-expired font-medium">14/01/26</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">30/11/26</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">30/11/26</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">$2M / $4M</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">$1M</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">$1M</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-expired-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 font-semibold text-status-expired border border-status-expired-border text-[9px]">VENCIDO</span></td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="hover:bg-muted/30 transition-colors">
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium border-r border-border">Northstar Electrical</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">—</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border">15/06/26</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">—</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">—</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">$1M</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2 border-r border-border text-muted-foreground">—</td>
                    <td class="px-3 py-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-sm bg-status-missing-bg px-1.5 py-0.5 font-semibold text-status-missing border border-status-missing-border text-[9px]">FALTANTE</span></td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* CTA */}
  <section class="spacing-section bg-background text-center">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-xl">
      <h2 class="text-h2 text-foreground spacing-heading">¿Listo para limpiar tus registros?</h2>
      <Button href="/es/upload" size="lg" class="mt-4 shadow-elevated">
        Comienza a Extraer Gratis
      </Button>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
